/S /H4
/P 52 0 R
/T (Generative AI is now part of daily work. An employee stuck on a problem pastes a device configuration, uploads an internal document or screenshots an admin console into an AI assistant. The employee means no harm, but the data now sits with the AI vendor.)
/E (Generative AI is now part of daily work. An employee stuck on a problem pastes a device configuration, uploads an internal document or screenshots an admin console into an AI assistant. The employee means no harm, but the data now sits with the AI vendor.)
