/S /H4
/P 52 0 R
/T (From there attackers can reach it without breaking into the organisation: through stolen AI accounts that keep the full chat history \(Group-IB found ChatGPT logins in more than 225,000 infostealer logs in 2023\), through chats shared by link that ended up in Google results \(2025\), and through data the vendor retains \(Samsung, 2023\).)
/E (From there attackers can reach it without breaking into the organisation: through stolen AI accounts that keep the full chat history \(Group-IB found ChatGPT logins in more than 225,000 infostealer logs in 2023\), through chats shared by link that ended up in Google results \(2025\), and through data the vendor retains \(Samsung, 2023\).)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [29]
>>
