/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 52 0 R
/T (SADIN is a protective middleware that combines four properties we did not find together in the tools we reviewed: \(1\) it reads Arabic, including classification stamps on scanned pages; \(2\) it inspects on the employee's device or the company's own server; \(3\) it redacts the sensitive part instead of blocking the whole task; \(4\) its policies map to NCA ECC-2:2024 and the NDMO levels.)
/E (SADIN is a protective middleware that combines four properties we did not find together in the tools we reviewed: \(1\) it reads Arabic, including classification stamps on scanned pages; \(2\) it inspects on the employee's device or the company's own server; \(3\) it redacts the sensitive part instead of blocking the whole task; \(4\) its policies map to NCA ECC-2:2024 and the NDMO levels.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [39]
>>
