/Title (SADIN is a protective middleware that combines four properties we did not find together in the tools we reviewed: \(1\) it reads Arabic, including classification stamps on scanned pages; \(2\) it inspects on the employee's device or the company's own server; \(3\) it redacts the sensitive part instead of blocking the whole task; \(4\) its policies map to NCA ECC-2:2024 and the NDMO levels.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 555 0 R
/First 583 0 R
/Last 583 0 R
/Count -1
>>
endobj
